  "reviewNotes": [
    "Original NEOMOD and modified NEOMOD are separate validated variants and must not be represented as aliases with identical scoring.",
    "The original seven-system source table is semantically structured but still remains unpublished/review-only.",
    "Modified NEOMOD source cells frequently list multiple findings in the same score cell; flattened HTML does not prove whether the intended combination logic is AND, OR, or another rule.",
    "Modified NEOMOD therefore remains non-executable until the original PDF/publication is visually reviewed.",
    "The modified microcirculation row visibly leaves an albumin interval between 30 and 39 g/L without an explicit score in the flattened source; MiniMed does not fill that gap.",
    "No low/moderate/high total-score categories are added."
  ]
